## Prefix example

In witness mode, 05000000000044332211aa decodes a version of 5, empty input/output vectors, locktime 287454020, and consumes 10 bytes as a prefix. Exact decoding rejects its remaining byte. This expectation follows the zero-flags state transition and little-endian locktime independently of execution.
